{"articleNo":"130238","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=130238&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[생활관]2015-하계방학 입사조건(식사선택/입사기간) 변경 및 입사포기 환불신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.06.11","hit":"2698","attachments":[{"name":"생활관 입사조건 변경 및 환불 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=130238&attachNo=74208"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2015-하계방학 생활관 입사자 입사조건(식사선택, 입사기간) 변경 및 입사포기에 따른 환불 신청을 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">다음과 같이 안내합니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#ed0000\"><u>아래 기간 이후에는 신청이 불가하오니, 필히 정해진 기간 내에 신청해 주시기 바랍니다.</u></font></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 신청기간&nbsp;: </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015. 6. 15(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 09:00 ~ 6. 17(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 17:00</span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">까지<!--StartFragment--></font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">* 마감 시간(17시) 이후 도착분은 인정 불가</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>* 오름관은 7일 의무식이므로 식사 변경 불가</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><font color=\"#5d5d5d\">2. 신청대상 : 2015-하계방학 생활관비 납부자</font></strong></span></span></p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 신청방법 : 행정실 방문 또는 이메일 신청</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1) 방문 접수</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 각 관 행정실(푸름관 : 관리동 2층 204호, 오름관 : 오름관1동&nbsp;102호)</span></p></div><div class=\"view_content\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2) 이메일 접수</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 각 관 담당자에게 메일 발송</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">가. 첨부파일의 양식 작성</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">나. <u>메일 제목에 신청 내용의 간략한 키워드와 본인의 이름 반드시 명시</u></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">예) 2015-하계방학 식사변경/또는 입사포기&nbsp;(유관순)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">다. 메일 발송</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; *푸름관 :&nbsp;<span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:jungyoon@kumoh.ac.kr\">jungyoon@kumoh.ac.kr</a></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;*오름관 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#8c8c8c\">&nbsp;</font><u><font color=\"#8c8c8c\"><a href=\"mailto:cutest@kumoh.ac.kr\">cutest@kumoh.ac.kr</a></font></u></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\"><font size=\"+0\"><strong>4. 납부기간 :</strong></font> </font></font><font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015. 6. 17.(</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 09:00 ~ 6. 18(</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">목</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 17:00(</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">조건 변경자에 한함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></strong></font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#ff007f\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청서 상의 본인 납부금액 확인하여 기재된 계좌번호로 입금</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#ff007f\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">반드시 기한 내 납부 바라며</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">미입금자는 자동 취소됨</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u></u></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u></u></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2015. 6. 11.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">금오공과대학교생활관</span></span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
